+iAIResearchPercent,118,112,106,100 (noble),94,88,82,76,70

diff --git a/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs_And_Appendixes/README_Main_Changes_Guide.md b/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs_And_Appendixes/README_Main_Changes_Guide.md
